"link":"","button_style_secondary":false,"atc_button_label":"","atc_product":"","atc_skip_cart":false,"desktop_alignment":"left","mobile_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"background-1","layout":"table_second","style":"centered","corner_radius":20,"number_of_competitors":1,"us_label":"Riva collections","us_label_size":18,"logo_width":90,"mobile_logo_width":60,"others_label":"Air Freshener Spray","others_label_size":18,"others_logo_width":90,"others_mobile_logo_width":60,"others_2_label":"Competitor 2","others_2_label_size":18,"others_2_logo_width":90,"others_2_mobile_logo_width":60,"others_3_label":"Competitor 3","others_3_label_size":18,"others_3_logo_width":90,"others_3_mobile_logo_width":60,"checkmark_style":"regular","checkmark_color":"#ffffff","checkmark_bg_color":"#53af01","x_style":"regular","x_color":"#ff0000","x_bg_color":"#dbdbdb","opposite_icon_colors":"original","highlighted_color_scheme":"accent-1","highlighted_separator_opacity":0,"highlighted_overlay_opacity":0,"other_cells_color_scheme":"background-1","regular_separator_opacity":10,"regular_overlay_opacity":0,"minimalistic_border_opacity":16,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":36,"custom_colors_background":"#ffffff","custom_gradient_background":"","custom_colors_text":"#2e2a39","custom_colors_solid_button_background":"#dd1d1d","custom_colors_solid_button_text":"#ffffff","custom_colors_outline_button":"#dd1d1d","custom_colors_highlighted_background":"#2e2a39","custom_colors_highlighted_text":"#ffffff","custom_colors_others_background":"#ffffff","custom_colors_others_text":"#2e2a39"}},"174375794036da818e":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"lai_product_reviews_lai_product_section_UFNLCk":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/lai-product-reviews\/blocks\/lai-product-section\/cad3c6c6-329e-4416-ba74-b79359b5b6e1","settings":{"lai_product":"","title":"","use_other_product":false}}},"block_order":["lai_product_reviews_lai_product_section_UFNLCk"],"settings":{"display_id":false,"include_margins":true}},"collapsible_content_EUY8hK":{"type":"collapsible-content","blocks":{"collapsible_row_q1":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is This An Air Purifier?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>No, and we would rather say so. It is a passive absorber — charcoal pores take up damp and odour molecules from the still air immediately around the bag. It does not filter a room, does not remove dust or smoke particles, and does nothing for allergies. In a shut shoe cupboard or a drawer it works well. In an open living room it will not do much, and anyone buying it as an air purifier will be disappointed.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_q2":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How Big An Area Does One Bag Cover?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Think in terms of enclosed spaces rather than square feet — a shoe cupboard, a wardrobe section, a drawer, a car interior. [FILL: state the supplier's coverage figure if you publish one, but frame it as enclosed volume.] For a whole cupboard, several small bags spread around work better than one bag in a corner.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_q3":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Does It Really Recharge In The Sun?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Sunlight dries the bag out and drives off the moisture it has taken up, which restores some of its capacity. It is a genuine effect, not a trick — but it is a refresh, not a reset. Expect it to work less well each year rather than performing identically for its whole stated life. Put it out on a dry sunny day, not during monsoon.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_q4":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is It Safe Around Children And Pets?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>The charcoal is in a sealed fabric bag and is not scented, so there is nothing to breathe in. The thing to watch is the bag being chewed or torn open — loose charcoal granules are a choking risk for a small child and a mess a dog will happily eat. Hang it out of reach, and if a bag splits, clear it up and replace it rather than taping it shut.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_q5":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What Can I Do With It When It Stops Working?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Cut it open and scatter the granules into garden soil or a potted plant, where charcoal helps with drainage and holds moisture. The linen bag goes in the bin. That is a real benefit over a plastic air freshener that simply becomes waste.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_q6":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How Many Bags Will I Need?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>[FILL: state how many bags come in a pack and suggest realistic quantities — for example one per shoe rack shelf, one per wardrobe section, one under a car seat. Buyers who order a single bag for a whole house come back disappointed.]<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_q1","collapsible_row_q2","collapsible_row_q3","collapsible_row_q4","collapsible_row_q5","collapsible_row_q6"],"custom_css":[".collapsible-content-wrapper-narrow {max-width: 100.4rem;}",".collapsible-none-layout details.accordion__details {background: #c7a3d1; color: #fff;}",".accordion .material-symbols-outlined {color: #fff;}",".accordion__title {color: #fff;}",".accordion.animate-item.animate-item--child.accordion--medium.accordion--top-border {margin-bottom: 15px;}",".accordion__details {padding: 0 10px;}"],"settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","caption":"","title":"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)","title_highlight_color":"#6d388b","heading_size":"h2","heading_alignment":"center","layout":"none","color_scheme":"background-1","container_color_scheme":"background-2","open_first_collapsible_row":false,"video_muted_autoplay":true,"image_ratio":"adapt","desktop_layout":"image_second","row_heading_size":"medium","collapse_icon":"carret","display_top_border":tr